OL,3,GNEWSAPrisoner who fled to Donegal seeks
OL,4,Areturn to NI, court hears
OL,5,
OL,6,FA convicted murderer who absconded from
OL,7,Fprison in Northern Ireland while on
OL,8,Fcompassionate leave and fled to the
OL,9,FRepublic of Ireland has asked his legal
OL,10,Fteam to arrange his return back across
OL,11,Fthe border, a court has heard.
OL,13,FGary Anderson, 29, who was serving a
OL,14,Flife sentence for the murder of Karol
OL,15,FKelly in 2018, fled after being given
OL,16,Fpermission to attend his father's
OL,17,Ffuneral in Londonderry last month.
OL,19,FHe was arrested by An Garda Siochana
OL,20,F(Irish police service) nine days later
OL,21,Fat a caravan park in County Donegal.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
