OL,3,GNEWSAPrisoner who fled to Donegal seeks
OL,4,Areturn to NI, court hears
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe appeared via video link at
OL,7,FLetterkenny District Court on Monday,
OL,8,Fcharged with being present on 23
OL,9,FSeptember at Fahan Marina Caravan and
OL,10,FCampsite having escaped Maghaberry
OL,11,FPrison.
